{"id":"3ac3ef82b276bb8f","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure.md","title":"ZFC Model10 Reduct Of Structure","display":"df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure — ZFC Model10 Reduct Of Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure — ZFC Model10 Reduct Of Structure","depends_on":["[[58-df-first-order-language]]","[[58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure — ZFC Model10 Reduct Of Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language\">58-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,L,L&#39;\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,L,L&#39;\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (carrier projection; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L.\\mathrm{Cst},L&#39;.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L&#39;.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n,L&#39;.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(L.\\mathrm{Cst},L&#39;.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L&#39;.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n,L&#39;.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> are the canonical symbol components of the two first-order languages (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language\">58-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10ReductOfStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10ReductOfStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}reduct\\text{-}of\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10ReductOfStructure}_S(\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,L,L&#39;)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal R,L)\\land L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Cst}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\land L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Rel}_n)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal R)=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(c^{\\mathcal R}=c^{\\mathcal M})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;(f^{\\mathcal R}=f^{\\mathcal M})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall Q\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;(Q^{\\mathcal R}=Q^{\\mathcal M})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}reduct\\text{-}of\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10ReductOfStructure}_S(\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,L,L&#39;)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal R,L)\\land L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Cst}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\land L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Rel}_n)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal R)=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(c^{\\mathcal R}=c^{\\mathcal M})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;(f^{\\mathcal R}=f^{\\mathcal M})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall Q\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;(Q^{\\mathcal R}=Q^{\\mathcal M})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sublanguage relation is componentwise in each arity, and the reduct keeps the carrier and every retained interpretation unchanged.</li>\n<li>The dependency follows the same first-order-language encoding used by the structure predicate; the alternate <code>df-language</code> tuple was not the source of these projections.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V$ (carrier projection; see [[58-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L.\\mathrm{Cst},L'.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L'.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n,L'.\\mathrm{Rel}_n$ are the canonical symbol components of the two first-order languages (see [[58-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,L,L'\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"L.\\mathrm{Cst},L'.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L'.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n,L'.\\mathrm{Rel}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10ReductOfStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}reduct\\text{-}of\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10ReductOfStructure}_S(\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,L,L')\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L')\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal R,L)\\land L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L'.\\mathrm{Cst}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\subseteq L'.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\land L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\subseteq L'.\\mathrm{Rel}_n)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal R)=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(c^{\\mathcal R}=c^{\\mathcal M})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;(f^{\\mathcal R}=f^{\\mathcal M})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall Q\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;(Q^{\\mathcal R}=Q^{\\mathcal M})","display":true}],"bytes":1893,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2731","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure.md|58-df-zfc-model10-reduct-of-structure]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["3888033a846b1cd5","d9b8711cda3f31ca"]}